# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). For a trial room sealing you in (game/trials.js; a rumble and the gate now): a memory that holds on to you.
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
title    Trial sealed
composer Claude
about    A memory that holds on to you: the knock and the thin glass ring of the title's cracking, held while time stands still, over a low D and a singing bowl.
tempo    72
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: knock bass ring bowl

voice knock    kick       vol=0.4
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6
voice ring     glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=0.3  rev=0.8 att=0.1 rel=1.2
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.3  pan=-0.1 rev=0.6

pattern held
knock   | X..... ...... |
bass    | D1!- .--------- |
ring    | G6----------- |
bowl    | D3----------- |

loop held
